WEBVTT

00:00:01.874 --> 00:00:03.904
What should we name it?

00:00:04.374 --> 00:00:08.434
I can't think of a boy name or
a girl name that we both like.

00:00:08.784 --> 00:00:10.984
Hey! Daddy's here!

00:00:10.984 --> 00:00:12.284
Mitsuo...

00:00:12.284 --> 00:00:16.014
Hold it, Sumire. I want it to be
a surprise when it's born.

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:17.624
Don't tell me, okay?

00:00:18.924 --> 00:00:20.484
They said it's an esper.

00:00:21.794 --> 00:00:23.954
We need to think of names
we can both agree on.

00:00:24.364 --> 00:00:26.604
If it's a boy, we'll call him Ichiro.

00:00:26.604 --> 00:00:30.294
Or maybe go for something
international, like Rulurov...

00:00:32.404 --> 00:00:33.134
Esper?

00:00:37.574 --> 00:00:39.444
I found out during my exam today.

00:00:40.444 --> 00:00:45.144
But the doctor said there's a chance its
powers would fade after birth, so...

00:00:46.924 --> 00:00:48.214
Mitsuo?

00:00:59.264 --> 00:01:02.164
It's pretty awesome, invincible power!

00:01:02.574 --> 00:01:05.434
Boy, does it feel great

00:01:05.804 --> 00:01:08.574
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:01:09.014 --> 00:01:12.174
Come on, let's head for tomorrow!

00:01:14.084 --> 00:01:15.214
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:15.214 --> 00:01:16.384
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:01:16.384 --> 00:01:17.654
Zettai Karen Children
Absolutely!

00:01:17.654 --> 00:01:19.324
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:19.324 --> 00:01:20.344
Zettai Karen Children
Daring!

00:01:20.524 --> 00:01:23.824
It just takes a touch for me to know

00:01:23.824 --> 00:01:26.254
The limiter on my heart

00:01:27.024 --> 00:01:29.694
Has been released, and then you see

00:01:30.134 --> 00:01:33.294
Yes! Change the world!

00:01:33.564 --> 00:01:36.404
Trying again and again through hot battle!

00:01:36.734 --> 00:01:40.044
Reaching through what's real

00:01:40.044 --> 00:01:43.274
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:01:43.274 --> 00:01:46.174
The thrills just can't be beat!

00:01:47.344 --> 00:01:53.824
Courage begins to light the
darkness of the world

00:01:53.824 --> 00:01:59.724
It overflows with the miracles you gave

00:02:00.164 --> 00:02:04.564
If you can take pride in a smile

00:02:04.564 --> 00:02:06.594
That suits no one else

00:02:06.764 --> 00:02:11.304
Then let's go beyond the future now

00:02:11.304 --> 00:02:15.434
We can try over the future world!

00:02:15.644 --> 00:02:16.004
Yeah!

00:02:16.744 --> 00:02:17.474
Ultimate!

00:02:19.544 --> 00:02:20.804
Daring!

00:02:29.694 --> 00:02:31.814
25th sense.
"A Prayer For An Easy Birth! Hello, Baby"

00:02:33.494 --> 00:02:35.964
We still haven't found Major Hyobu?

00:02:36.534 --> 00:02:38.254
We're trying everything we can, but...

00:02:38.794 --> 00:02:41.464
Besides that, powerful espers are

00:02:41.464 --> 00:02:46.494
going missing all over the world
and vanishing from prisons.

00:02:47.074 --> 00:02:49.234
More of Hyobu's doing, I'd wager.

00:02:49.774 --> 00:02:51.904
We can't rule out the possibility.

00:02:52.414 --> 00:02:57.354
Meaning he's gathered a significant
number of espers around him, right?

00:02:57.854 --> 00:03:00.684
I want BABEL to build a future

00:03:00.684 --> 00:03:05.814
where espers and Normals can
join hands in friendship.

00:03:08.524 --> 00:03:10.754
Whatever PANDRA and the "queen" are,

00:03:11.334 --> 00:03:13.264
I won't let them stop that.

00:03:16.174 --> 00:03:18.304
Are we making smooth progress?

00:03:18.304 --> 00:03:22.204
Yes, it's all going according to plan.

00:03:22.204 --> 00:03:24.644
Thank you. I know this has been tough for you.

00:03:25.644 --> 00:03:29.084
You were just a child when I
first brought you onboard.

00:03:30.284 --> 00:03:33.414
The strain's made you look old before your time!

00:03:35.154 --> 00:03:40.094
Don't you think you should make
yourself look a bit more mature?

00:03:41.324 --> 00:03:44.764
Perish the thought! I leave the tough stuff to you.

00:03:46.504 --> 00:03:48.224
We're nearly to the shield now!

00:04:06.124 --> 00:04:07.344
We're home!

00:04:07.854 --> 00:04:10.324
PANDRA's homeland!

00:04:41.754 --> 00:04:43.914
Try not to drop the husks on me.

00:04:44.554 --> 00:04:46.864
When will Kaoru come to the island?

00:04:46.864 --> 00:04:49.234
Don't be hasty. We'll wait a bit more.

00:04:49.234 --> 00:04:50.494
Wait how long?

00:04:50.894 --> 00:04:56.304
Until she realizes that espers
and Normals cannot coexist.

00:04:56.674 --> 00:04:59.294
We won't have long to wait.

00:04:59.544 --> 00:05:02.274
Ooh, I can't wait till she does!

00:05:02.274 --> 00:05:05.874
When she does, I'll take her under
my wing, since I'm her senior here!

00:05:05.874 --> 00:05:08.814
The time is drawing near, my queen.

00:05:13.024 --> 00:05:18.724
Huh? Canceled? Mom, you did
this to me last time, too!

00:05:19.664 --> 00:05:21.764
Sis can't come, either?

00:05:21.764 --> 00:05:23.694
What's the deal?

00:05:24.594 --> 00:05:27.724
Fine, I get it. I'll eat by myself and then go back.

00:05:28.564 --> 00:05:30.974
It's fine. You don't have to apologize.

00:05:30.974 --> 00:05:33.094
Good luck with your work. Later.

00:05:36.614 --> 00:05:39.904
Darn it, I was looking forward to this, too.

00:05:42.544 --> 00:05:44.484
Absolutely Chiru-Chiru!

00:05:47.284 --> 00:05:48.224
I'm home.

00:05:48.224 --> 00:05:49.344
Welcome back!

00:05:55.124 --> 00:05:55.894
Kaoru?

00:05:55.964 --> 00:05:58.554
Welcome back! Did you have fun at dinner?

00:05:58.994 --> 00:06:03.024
Yeah. I'm full, so I'm going to bed.

00:06:08.844 --> 00:06:10.514
We're off!

00:06:10.514 --> 00:06:14.314
See you later. And watch out for cars!

00:06:15.484 --> 00:06:16.714
I'm off.

00:06:21.484 --> 00:06:23.694
Kaoru, did something happen last night?

00:06:23.694 --> 00:06:26.454
Like what? Nothing, really.

00:06:28.924 --> 00:06:30.414
It's Chisato!

00:06:30.694 --> 00:06:31.964
Good morning!

00:06:32.804 --> 00:06:33.964
Good morning, everyone!

00:06:38.434 --> 00:06:39.994
See you, Minamoto!

00:06:42.304 --> 00:06:45.614
Say, why is it you three are
always leaving early together

00:06:45.614 --> 00:06:47.604
and come to school together?

00:06:48.414 --> 00:06:53.074
Well... There's a lot of reasons
for that. Like cases, and...

00:06:54.754 --> 00:06:56.584
Because our parents all work together!

00:06:57.594 --> 00:07:02.024
See, they all work at the same job, so...

00:07:02.024 --> 00:07:03.494
Right! Right!

00:07:05.364 --> 00:07:06.904
Kaoru, no!

00:07:06.904 --> 00:07:08.094
Keep it secret!

00:07:08.864 --> 00:07:10.474
Jeez, I know!

00:07:10.474 --> 00:07:11.974
What do they do?

00:07:11.974 --> 00:07:12.764
Yipe!

00:07:14.374 --> 00:07:19.104
Um... They, uh... Pass!

00:07:20.084 --> 00:07:23.104
Uh, they... Uh... You take it! Pass!

00:07:23.854 --> 00:07:24.944
Government jobs.

00:07:25.054 --> 00:07:26.014
Right!

00:07:26.014 --> 00:07:27.684
That's it! That's totally it!

00:07:28.384 --> 00:07:30.944
But, there're all sorts of government jobs, right?

00:07:31.494 --> 00:07:35.264
And that young man, Mr. Minamoto?

00:07:35.264 --> 00:07:37.124
What's his relationship with you?

00:07:39.094 --> 00:07:40.334
Tono!

00:07:40.334 --> 00:07:41.394
Hey there, Akashi.

00:07:42.034 --> 00:07:43.734
I challenge you to a game of tops!

00:07:43.734 --> 00:07:46.304
Okay, but prepare to be beat!

00:07:46.304 --> 00:07:46.844
Bring it on!

00:07:46.844 --> 00:07:48.174
I'll go, too!
Bring it on!

00:07:48.174 --> 00:07:49.304
Wait!
Bring it on!

00:07:50.514 --> 00:07:54.604
I'd swear they were hiding something.

00:07:55.714 --> 00:07:58.114
I didn't win today, either.

00:08:01.554 --> 00:08:07.324
How can espers and Normals
really get along better?

00:08:12.934 --> 00:08:13.954
Mr. Hyobu...

00:08:15.234 --> 00:08:16.464
Miss Akashi!

00:08:17.174 --> 00:08:18.104
Yes?!

00:08:18.104 --> 00:08:20.834
No daydreaming! Class is in session now.

00:08:22.944 --> 00:08:24.174
Sorry...

00:08:27.444 --> 00:08:29.854
What is wrong with Kaoru?

00:08:29.854 --> 00:08:31.974
I wonder what she's thinking about.

00:08:40.994 --> 00:08:41.684
Sorry!

00:08:42.594 --> 00:08:45.864
No, I'm the one who should apologize.

00:08:49.774 --> 00:08:50.754
What's wrong?

00:08:52.034 --> 00:08:53.504
That lady...

00:08:53.644 --> 00:08:54.974
The pregnant one?

00:08:55.174 --> 00:08:57.504
What's wrong with her?

00:08:57.744 --> 00:08:59.474
She's worried about something.

00:08:59.584 --> 00:09:01.374
No... Sad about something.

00:09:04.484 --> 00:09:05.504
Sad?

00:09:05.884 --> 00:09:07.374
It seemed that way.

00:09:07.924 --> 00:09:11.924
But isn't having a baby
supposed to be a happy thing?

00:09:11.924 --> 00:09:16.154
Right. I don't think there's any
parent who isn't happy about it.

00:09:16.634 --> 00:09:19.564
I wonder if my mom happy when she had me.

00:09:19.564 --> 00:09:21.134
Of course.

00:09:21.134 --> 00:09:22.264
Even though I'm an esper?

00:09:22.364 --> 00:09:25.304
Why do you ask? Of course she was happy.

00:09:27.004 --> 00:09:28.064
I see.

00:09:29.244 --> 00:09:32.504
I'm also glad that you girls were born.

00:09:34.014 --> 00:09:36.004
Because we were able to meet like this.

00:09:37.584 --> 00:09:38.684
Minamoto.

00:09:38.684 --> 00:09:39.614
Kaoru.

00:09:39.954 --> 00:09:40.544
Aoi.

00:09:41.354 --> 00:09:41.984
Shiho.

00:09:43.294 --> 00:09:45.654
Thank you for being born.

00:09:46.154 --> 00:09:47.354
Mr. Minamoto.

00:09:47.824 --> 00:09:48.764
Mr. Minamoto.

00:09:49.364 --> 00:09:53.924
Aw, jeez... Don't say such
embarrassing things, Minamoto!

00:09:56.274 --> 00:09:58.764
Maybe it'd been better if we hadn't met...

00:10:03.844 --> 00:10:04.744
It's getting bigger.

00:10:04.744 --> 00:10:05.734
Yeah.

00:10:08.514 --> 00:10:10.744
It's a baby elephant!

00:10:12.784 --> 00:10:15.754
A major landslide has occurred at Mt. Gohya.

00:10:15.924 --> 00:10:20.264
A tunnel collapsed and several passing
vehicles have been trapped inside.

00:10:20.264 --> 00:10:22.594
Special espers, move out!

00:10:28.164 --> 00:10:31.934
It looks like a number of cars have
been trapped inside the tunnel.

00:10:32.174 --> 00:10:35.194
Rescue will take a long time,
even with heavy machinery.

00:10:37.074 --> 00:10:41.314
All right, let's begin rescue operations.

00:10:41.314 --> 00:10:42.334
Wait!

00:10:42.784 --> 00:10:45.584
Get those media helicopters out of the area first!

00:10:47.054 --> 00:10:50.194
We can't let them get pictures of the girls.

00:10:50.194 --> 00:10:51.854
Yes, Chief! At once!

00:10:51.994 --> 00:10:52.994
SCENE OF TUNNEL LANDSLIDE

00:10:52.994 --> 00:10:54.264
SCENE OF TUNNEL LANDSLIDE
What are you watching?

00:10:55.594 --> 00:10:57.184
Prepare the boat.

00:10:58.734 --> 00:11:01.004
Huh? It's an order?

00:11:01.004 --> 00:11:02.864
Wait!

00:11:05.274 --> 00:11:08.044
All right, let's try this again!

00:11:08.044 --> 00:11:08.874
Yeah!

00:11:09.204 --> 00:11:12.004
Special espers The Children, released!

00:11:12.314 --> 00:11:14.404
Neither rain nor wind will beat us!

00:11:14.744 --> 00:11:16.874
If someone is troubled, we'll
extend a helping hand!

00:11:17.114 --> 00:11:19.214
That's the kind of person I want to be!

00:11:20.254 --> 00:11:22.274
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:11:26.394 --> 00:11:28.864
Minor injuries. He's just unconscious.

00:11:29.194 --> 00:11:30.564
R-Roger.

00:11:31.034 --> 00:11:32.734
They did that instantly.

00:11:32.734 --> 00:11:36.994
That's amazing power.
Do they even need us here?

00:11:37.434 --> 00:11:39.404
No, it's not like that!

00:11:40.644 --> 00:11:46.044
Psychic powers can't do everything,
and those girls aren't magicians.

00:11:46.114 --> 00:11:50.374
I don't think having great power
means you can handle everything.

00:11:51.114 --> 00:11:54.084
Everyone here has to do all that they can.

00:11:55.554 --> 00:11:59.584
They may be espers, but they're
still just little kids.

00:12:00.394 --> 00:12:04.764
Their abilities bring them nothing
but trouble in normal life.

00:12:05.734 --> 00:12:10.134
For their sake and the sake
of many other espers,

00:12:10.134 --> 00:12:14.194
they must constantly use
them to prove themselves.

00:12:14.444 --> 00:12:15.604
Prove what?

00:12:16.004 --> 00:12:20.874
That psychic powers can help people
and bring happiness to them.

00:12:24.014 --> 00:12:24.984
Now, Aoi!

00:12:24.984 --> 00:12:26.384
I'm on it!

00:12:30.494 --> 00:12:33.654
Unconscious from the blow to his chest,
but life signs are stable.

00:12:37.434 --> 00:12:38.864
How many more?

00:12:38.864 --> 00:12:40.924
Just a passenger in a taxi.

00:12:41.364 --> 00:12:42.604
Piece of cake!

00:12:42.604 --> 00:12:43.794
Leave it to us!

00:12:44.504 --> 00:12:45.194
Please.

00:12:51.144 --> 00:12:53.514
Okay, now we can rescue them.

00:12:55.114 --> 00:12:56.704
Huh? This is...

00:12:57.114 --> 00:12:57.814
From before!

00:12:59.984 --> 00:13:01.784
The baby inside is okay.

00:13:02.724 --> 00:13:04.254
That's a relief!

00:13:04.254 --> 00:13:06.414
But the mother isn't.

00:13:06.594 --> 00:13:08.324
Let's get her to the hospital, fast!

00:13:08.324 --> 00:13:11.294
Roger! All right, we're headed back.

00:13:11.294 --> 00:13:12.454
Wait!

00:13:12.694 --> 00:13:13.754
What's?

00:13:14.464 --> 00:13:16.334
Aoi, your body!

00:13:16.704 --> 00:13:18.504
What? There's trouble?

00:13:18.504 --> 00:13:19.594
What happened?

00:13:20.444 --> 00:13:22.634
Are you okay? You're not hurt, are you?!

00:13:22.804 --> 00:13:24.674
No, it's not that...

00:13:24.674 --> 00:13:26.584
Spit it out! What's happened?!

00:13:26.584 --> 00:13:30.584
Something's gone wrong
with Aoi's teleportation.

00:13:30.584 --> 00:13:34.984
Get me out! Kaoru, get me out of here, now!

00:13:35.084 --> 00:13:39.024
And my powers have weakened, too.

00:13:40.694 --> 00:13:42.894
Looks like we can't get back.

00:13:42.894 --> 00:13:44.094
What?!

00:13:45.864 --> 00:13:51.704
My powers have weakened too,
so I can't scan very deep, but...

00:13:53.004 --> 00:13:54.264
What's wrong?

00:13:54.404 --> 00:13:56.614
The baby's causing this.

00:13:56.614 --> 00:13:58.044
What?!

00:13:59.014 --> 00:14:02.144
It's an esper. A powerful one.

00:14:03.484 --> 00:14:07.644
Its psychic waves are jamming our powers.

00:14:10.554 --> 00:14:12.024
The baby's an esper?

00:14:12.024 --> 00:14:13.584
What should we do, Minamoto?

00:14:14.624 --> 00:14:17.924
Digging you out with heavy
machinery will take half a day.

00:14:18.394 --> 00:14:19.934
Can you wait that long?

00:14:19.934 --> 00:14:23.764
We don't have that much time.
The mother's getting weaker.

00:14:24.974 --> 00:14:27.164
Gotcha. Don't worry. Just sit tight.

00:14:27.504 --> 00:14:28.404
Okay?

00:14:30.244 --> 00:14:32.074
Hey, Kaoru? Do you read me?

00:14:32.074 --> 00:14:33.734
Shiho! Aoi!

00:14:34.884 --> 00:14:36.044
Mr. Minamoto!

00:14:36.044 --> 00:14:37.254
Minamoto!

00:14:37.254 --> 00:14:39.354
Communications are cut.

00:14:39.354 --> 00:14:41.454
Is it the baby's power, too?

00:14:41.454 --> 00:14:42.384
Probably.

00:14:44.454 --> 00:14:46.354
What's Mr. Minamoto going to do?

00:14:47.164 --> 00:14:49.824
Since he said to wait and not worry...

00:14:50.294 --> 00:14:52.124
All we can do it sit here and trust him.

00:14:53.034 --> 00:14:57.404
It'll be all right. I know he'll come and save us...

00:14:58.604 --> 00:14:59.364
Shiho?

00:14:59.704 --> 00:15:01.834
The baby... It's scared.

00:15:02.674 --> 00:15:05.474
It's scared of being born!

00:15:09.954 --> 00:15:14.184
It's dad and mom are both scared
of it being born an esper.

00:15:14.954 --> 00:15:18.654
It senses that and is scared of
coming out into the world.

00:15:19.494 --> 00:15:22.054
So it lost control!

00:15:32.034 --> 00:15:33.404
No way...

00:15:49.484 --> 00:15:53.054
Sumire! Eri, or Ichiro! Possibly Rulurov!

00:15:53.154 --> 00:15:54.224
H-Hold it!

00:15:54.224 --> 00:15:56.324
I'm coming to save you!

00:15:57.934 --> 00:16:00.124
Sumire! Eri or Ichiro!

00:16:00.464 --> 00:16:01.454
Who's?

00:16:02.364 --> 00:16:05.894
Minamoto. We're almost ready to go.

00:16:07.574 --> 00:16:08.774
Rulurov!

00:16:08.774 --> 00:16:11.474
It's dangerous! Please, move back!

00:16:12.374 --> 00:16:13.414
But!

00:16:13.414 --> 00:16:15.844
We'll get them out, I promise!

00:16:20.224 --> 00:16:21.954
Kaoru!

00:16:22.524 --> 00:16:24.924
It's... kinda hard...

00:16:26.354 --> 00:16:28.324
Don't look so down.

00:16:29.364 --> 00:16:33.194
Minamoto will come to save us, soon.

00:16:35.034 --> 00:16:35.934
Yeah.

00:16:36.234 --> 00:16:40.294
So we have to try and hang on till then!

00:16:43.344 --> 00:16:44.534
Mr. Minamoto...

00:16:46.114 --> 00:16:48.514
Hey, baby. You hear me in there?

00:16:49.744 --> 00:16:54.084
We've had a lot of sad and
painful things happen

00:16:54.084 --> 00:16:56.614
since we were born espers.

00:16:57.524 --> 00:16:59.654
Our parents were scared of us,

00:16:59.724 --> 00:17:03.454
we couldn't go to school
and we had no friends.

00:17:04.134 --> 00:17:08.564
But there's plenty of good things
about being an esper, too!

00:17:08.564 --> 00:17:09.334
Kaoru!

00:17:10.004 --> 00:17:13.444
We've had plenty of happy things, too!

00:17:13.444 --> 00:17:16.574
Because somebody told us they
were glad to have met us!

00:17:16.574 --> 00:17:20.244
Yeah! There's nothing to be scared of!

00:17:20.244 --> 00:17:22.234
We're here for you!

00:17:22.344 --> 00:17:25.614
That's right! We'll protect you!

00:17:25.684 --> 00:17:29.454
Right! So just relax and get born already!

00:17:32.824 --> 00:17:33.724
Kaoru!

00:17:34.824 --> 00:17:36.194
I'm... okay!

00:17:45.274 --> 00:17:46.894
I've got their exact position.

00:17:47.574 --> 00:17:49.274
Kaoru can't hold out much longer!

00:17:49.274 --> 00:17:52.304
Aim for the large crack inside the rocks!

00:17:53.044 --> 00:17:54.034
Roger!

00:17:54.444 --> 00:17:56.244
Naomi, are you ready?

00:17:56.344 --> 00:17:58.184
Yes, sir! Any time now!

00:17:58.754 --> 00:18:01.114
It'll be all right. The calculations are right.

00:18:01.684 --> 00:18:05.684
And that rock Kaoru's holding
up should protect them.

00:18:06.054 --> 00:18:07.624
Minamoto!

00:18:08.864 --> 00:18:10.354
FIRE!

00:18:21.174 --> 00:18:22.644
MINAMOTO!

00:18:42.094 --> 00:18:43.284
Everybody! Now!

00:18:51.004 --> 00:18:52.024
You okay?

00:18:52.434 --> 00:18:53.494
Thank goodness!

00:18:54.204 --> 00:18:55.264
Good job!

00:18:59.644 --> 00:19:01.444
You made it.

00:19:03.384 --> 00:19:05.214
I can teleport!

00:19:07.824 --> 00:19:10.254
Maybe the baby understood us.

00:19:12.294 --> 00:19:14.414
W-We're saved?

00:19:18.294 --> 00:19:19.394
Thank God!

00:19:19.394 --> 00:19:23.734
Sumire! Erika or Ichiro!
Thank God you're safe...

00:19:25.674 --> 00:19:27.834
Great job!

00:19:28.004 --> 00:19:30.214
Jeez, it took you long enough.

00:19:30.214 --> 00:19:31.934
We got tired, waiting for you!

00:19:32.144 --> 00:19:33.944
We could have died!

00:19:33.944 --> 00:19:34.704
Sorry.

00:19:35.584 --> 00:19:38.084
Locating you, correctly determining

00:19:38.084 --> 00:19:41.524
the condition of the rocks, targeting the beam,

00:19:41.884 --> 00:19:44.614
and preparing for entry all took time.

00:19:45.154 --> 00:19:46.624
Everyone helped.

00:19:46.724 --> 00:19:47.624
Everyone?

00:19:47.624 --> 00:19:49.024
Yes, everyone.

00:19:50.234 --> 00:19:53.564
Everyone from BABEL, the rescue
team, the fire department...

00:19:53.664 --> 00:19:56.034
This came from everyone working together.

00:19:56.034 --> 00:19:57.234
Well done!

00:19:57.234 --> 00:19:58.394
You did great!

00:20:05.574 --> 00:20:06.674
What's wrong, Kaoru?

00:20:08.444 --> 00:20:10.434
No, it's nothing.

00:20:11.614 --> 00:20:14.714
See? Being an esper has its good side, too.

00:20:15.384 --> 00:20:15.944
Right?

00:20:18.624 --> 00:20:21.384
That's the future which BABEL desires.

00:20:21.824 --> 00:20:27.024
A future where esper and Normal
live and work together.

00:20:27.364 --> 00:20:30.204
Yes. And I know that future will come.

00:20:30.734 --> 00:20:33.104
When I see those children, that's what I think.

00:20:36.104 --> 00:20:38.734
That's why I won't let you interfere with that...

00:20:38.844 --> 00:20:41.004
PANDRA. Hyobu!

00:20:42.544 --> 00:20:44.514
You helped Kaoru, didn't you?

00:20:44.514 --> 00:20:46.454
Perhaps, but not so she'd notice.

00:20:47.024 --> 00:20:49.354
I don't want the queen to be hurt.

00:20:49.654 --> 00:20:54.114
Besides, that baby may join us in the future.

00:20:54.624 --> 00:20:57.394
You really like 'em young, don't you?

00:20:57.394 --> 00:20:59.894
What was that?! You little rodent!

00:20:59.894 --> 00:21:01.734
You pedo!

00:21:02.134 --> 00:21:04.534
DELIVERY ROOM

00:21:08.474 --> 00:21:10.064
It's finally born!

00:21:10.514 --> 00:21:12.304
Thank you for being born!

00:21:14.844 --> 00:21:17.514
That family will be just fine.

00:21:17.514 --> 00:21:21.624
The father and mother are happy
from the bottom of their hearts.

00:21:21.624 --> 00:21:24.214
Thank goodness it was born safely!

00:21:24.654 --> 00:21:28.114
No parent isn't happy when
their child is born...

00:21:29.024 --> 00:21:32.254
I just know that espers and
Normals can get along.

00:21:33.494 --> 00:21:34.654
They can!

00:21:35.064 --> 00:21:36.534
Hey, Minamoto.

00:21:36.864 --> 00:21:39.264
I'd like to have your baby!

00:21:40.604 --> 00:21:42.204
Oh! Me, too! Me, too!

00:21:42.204 --> 00:21:45.014
Ah, but do you know how to make a baby?

00:21:45.014 --> 00:21:48.134
I dunno, but Minamoto must.

00:21:49.244 --> 00:21:52.654
Mr. Minamoto, I'd like a girl and a boy!

00:21:52.654 --> 00:21:54.344
I'd like twins.

00:21:54.424 --> 00:21:57.254
C'mon, tell us how they're made!

00:21:57.254 --> 00:21:59.624
Quit playing around!

00:22:00.564 --> 00:22:01.864
Minamoto's mad now!

00:22:01.864 --> 00:22:02.824
But why?

00:22:02.824 --> 00:22:04.054
I don't understand!

00:22:04.494 --> 00:22:08.364
Hey! Stop teasing grown-ups!

00:22:10.674 --> 00:22:16.104
Because, you're my heart's desire!

00:22:16.104 --> 00:22:16.404
Yeah

00:22:33.454 --> 00:22:36.724
When it comes to you, you see

00:22:38.494 --> 00:22:43.994
My ESP is no good at all

00:22:44.334 --> 00:22:50.464
Love is a puzzle that even

00:22:50.844 --> 00:22:53.144
Pythagoras couldn't solve

00:22:55.344 --> 00:23:00.084
Don't hang your head or have a tearful face

00:23:00.524 --> 00:23:05.354
Because miracles are born from smiles

00:23:06.054 --> 00:23:07.494
My, my, my heart's desire

00:23:07.494 --> 00:23:07.764
Zoom zoom!

00:23:07.764 --> 00:23:08.764
I want to make

00:23:08.764 --> 00:23:09.224
Bye-bye!

00:23:09.224 --> 00:23:12.954
You my bold desire

00:23:13.094 --> 00:23:17.074
So absolutely serious, it gives me chills!

00:23:17.074 --> 00:23:18.574
Trans, trans, transform

00:23:18.574 --> 00:23:18.804
Zoom zoom!

00:23:18.804 --> 00:23:19.774
I'll give you

00:23:19.774 --> 00:23:20.444
Yeah yeah!

00:23:20.444 --> 00:23:25.374
A dynamite kiss!

00:23:25.374 --> 00:23:28.144
I absolutely want you to love me!

00:23:28.144 --> 00:23:38.344
Because, you're my heart's desire

00:23:39.894 --> 00:23:40.594
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.594 --> 00:23:42.894
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.894 --> 00:23:42.994
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.994 --> 00:23:44.824
His predictions are always dead on.

00:23:44.894 --> 00:23:46.664
They're unavoidable.

00:23:46.664 --> 00:23:48.064
What's the prediction of?

00:23:48.234 --> 00:23:50.204
Of my own death.

00:23:50.204 --> 00:23:53.074
But the truth is there's
another important prediction,

00:23:53.074 --> 00:23:55.104
and if possible, I'd like to prevent it.

00:23:55.104 --> 00:23:56.404
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:56.404 --> 00:23:59.604
Episode 26: "A Change of Prediction?
The Future Dances!"

00:23:59.844 --> 00:24:01.784
At this range, you'll definitely kill me.

00:24:01.784 --> 00:24:03.044
Shoot, Minamoto.

00:24:03.044 --> 00:24:04.954
Kaoru, don't!

00:24:04.954 --> 00:24:05.014
A Change of Prediction?
The Future Dances!
Kaoru, don't!

00:24:05.014 --> 00:24:07.254
A Change of Prediction?
The Future Dances!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:07.254 --> 00:24:09.884
A Change of Prediction?
The Future Dances!
